sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Admin on destination
    participant UI as Apply dialog
    participant API as Server
    U->>UI: Apply
    UI->>API: apply
    API-->>UI: Blocked. C is missing. Proposed home: Q. Consumers: P, Q.
    U->>UI: Add credential C, enter the secrets
    UI->>API: Create C in Q with the source id
    UI-->>U: Access to grant: C for project P
    U->>UI: Grant access and apply
    UI->>API: Continue with grant list [C, P]
    API->>API: Check permission, share C with P, import
    API-->>UI: Applied. Result lists the grant.
